{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>元朗今日（15日）發生火警。傍晚6時40分，警方接獲報案指，元朗西鐵站一出口天橋下有草叢著火。網上圖片可見，草叢燒起烈焰，冒出白煙，在場不少途人駐足觀望。</p><p>消防接報趕抵現場後，證實一幅兩米乘以兩米的草叢起火，火勢於10分鐘後救熄，事件中無人受傷。經消防調查，懷疑因亂拋煙蒂引致，起火原因無可疑。</p><figure><img alt=\"元朗西鐵站一出口天橋下，有草叢著火。（Threads l._.aaa_i_22）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187508303983284224187425.png/dqsV1tV-eF4yYIk34SFls239q9B9t8JTZ2ObuGdjm7g\"/><figcaption>元朗西鐵站一出口天橋下，有草叢著火。（Threads l._.aaa_i_22）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防接報趕抵現場後，證實一幅兩米乘以兩米的草叢起火，火勢於10分鐘後救熄。（Threads l._.aaa_i_22）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187508306705518592213678.jpeg/x7Slnv6x8J6tfKyN1oQEX3-PF-aSuG9MywaF_8sGhf8\"/><figcaption>消防接報趕抵現場後，證實一幅兩米乘以兩米的草叢起火，火勢於10分鐘後救熄。（Threads l._.aaa_i_22）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T13:19:39.621512+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T13:06:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:58:02.304757+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:17:41.710741+00:00","content_hash":"aad0af869e973c5c0b8402d5258ac5e0a826ecd5614d26e5f7c6dc470bd516b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}